SELECT *
INTO Students_Backup
FROM Students;

SELECT INTO creates the new table Students_Backup with the same columns and copies every row (SQL Server / Access syntax).
MySQL/PostgreSQL equivalent: CREATE TABLE Students_Backup AS SELECT * FROM Students;

